                "text": "I will not support this bill that completely fails to help Americans afford their health care.\n\nTrump and Republicans more than doubled Americans\u2019 health care premiums, and for 40 days they have refused to lift a finger to do a thing about it. In fact, they\u2019ve made it worse by taking food away from kids.\n\nAllowing this to pass is a mistake.",
